# Mitigating Bias

Prompting is one of the most immediate ways to influence the quality and inclusiveness of AI responses. By adding context, asking for multiple perspectives, and challenging assumptions, you can guide AI toward more balanced and representative outputs.

Below are examples of how prompting can be used to improve AI responses.

