## Looking Beyond Prompting

While prompting can improve AI outputs, it does not eliminate bias. Even well-crafted prompts can still produce incomplete, unbalanced, or biased responses.

Mitigating bias requires awareness, intentional use, and critical evaluation.

* Awareness helps you recognize when bias may be present
* Intentional use ensures you are guiding AI toward inclusive outcomes
* Critical evaluation allows you to question, revise, and adapt outputs before using them

